  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "从数百种暴力招式中组装战斗机器，一路打上荒诞公司的晋升阶梯。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose from hundreds of unique moves to construct the perfect combat machine and fight your way to the top of the corporate ladder.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2085540/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "偷车、镇压抗议者、绑架检查员，靠一系列可疑任务扩张公司。",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Perform dubiously legal tasks critical to expanding the company. Steal cars, suppress protestors, and kidnap building inspectors, all in the name of profit.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2085540/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "用关卡编辑器经营并布置自己的公司，再通过Steam Workshop分享和体验社区公司。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Build out your own company with our Level Builder. Take control of hiring, firing, furnishing, marketing, and catering decisions as you upload your creations to the Steam Workshop.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2085540/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
